#: c06d2e6eb85e4b25bd25a72ca3f074cf db15b9f6a9a34ecdaad7ba5476469887
msgid ""
"In general, F4 based autopilots using an external bi-directional inverter "
"can use any UART with the following configuration:"
msgstr "通常，使用外置双向逆变器的基于 F4 的飞控可以在任意 UART 上使用以下配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:38
#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:44
#: 1979e1c81a3449df9ad90a31282efc88 2e05a34c05fe49bd8538cbc369516aad
#: 5fab722e88524fd288d499f2fdb7b3ec 763b81d50af14dd9afbdff65a7f0eb75
