#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:42
#: 446d1e12616445b28dfe681b53c178d5 8e681580b12c4ecda04483aa6fd0a998
#: 9349717127244490ac2a9adcfb165ff6 9dba894c0b5b4f9da4cd40789f6862a7
#: a7cf7147a00541f783e08ca80b582dcd c096757f747b4a2391874dffa4286056
msgid ""
"F4 based autopilots using an \"un-inverted FPort\" output from the receiver "
"can connect it to any UART's TX pin with the configuration:"
msgstr "使用接收机「非反转 FPort」输出的 F4 飞控可将其连接至任意 UART 的 TX 引脚，并使用以下配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:45
#: 09ff7222a84041c6bbf1891ff834412e 1befd9fbaaa84438bf3407aaec626f51
#: 85f7015ec42441eab2cf724389f177c5 c7b0b6fecdc24e08b20d3e07ccbd85fd
#: d7bef7e7737145cb8875ed8332acf95c e0af9f05ca0b42e2a74352d6b3deb335
msgid ""
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4 (Half Duplex), or = 132 (Half Duplex, TX Pull-up) if"
" receiver does not have sufficient drive on the \"un-inverted\" output"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4（半双工），若接收机的「非反转」输出驱动能力不足，可设为 = 132（半双工，TX 上拉）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:48
#: 5f7355920cbf47f9b1f7db070864ba84 76046142ae4741ef98e4f59e65216a15
#: a414692914d54101b77f82622161cb1a bb0bfa07be1649df9fc476b5ec98acc9
#: df9ae31577af461eb1dd9b3ee3b744a2 e2550309b7d646e5aca968fafa187d03
msgid ""
"F4 based autopilots cannot use the RX pin with an \"un-inverted FPort\" "
"output since the SWAP capability is only available in F7/H7 based autopilots"
" and Half Duplex requires connection the UART TX pin."
msgstr ""
"F4 飞控不能使用 RX 引脚连接「非反转 FPort」输出，因为 SWAP 功能仅在 F7/H7 飞控上可用，且半双工模式需连接 UART TX "
"引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:51
#: 127ea22e99f2460ca063a19e6e6e1595 1bbbe2bb8ea04647a654802dbd09c777
#: 38f2577ff0744394b5b5b2b97976e0f1 7f64a1296c134d9d8f426bf35a47a895
#: adb3916214aa4afd949bfaf45d790f89 f19b0c2a65a24816afef40cb99150602
msgid ""
"F7/H7 based autopilots can directly connect to the TX pin of any UART and "
"use this configuration:"
msgstr "基于 F7/H7 的飞控可直接连接到任意 UART 的 TX 引脚，并使用以下配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:53
#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:59
#: 01665833acee4a4f8e04d5df039e78f8 4b38b3c3b0bb4be7a6ddc6017a1341ab
#: 4e662ad40b9a4cb1b6d646dc4840e5ed 513cdb2ddc364244b4a113ddcdb4b10d
#: 5365783b65574e56a4acb398d7c446f4 5eff64c5f5de41e4a667e7f200ba236f
#: 7e3940255cef4079875a830d04af2eb6 922983cdd4c24729ac8b914470abf153
#: dec4a7310d8345acb760bf6967d82889 e8b7ab0270974697816427633b724565
#: f2d7c884568b4ea48e1308dcf664f690 f891647f569640b39b95d5506fc63bb2
msgid "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` =23"
msgstr "``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` =23"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:54
#: 3da220572f9f403f8080be421fc0c7d0 616c636fa56547f4ae1a66ab2ec22414
#: 83eaaf8201654ff89c7ebb5248b83125 97fcb160eb1f4b0ebec73a339b49895f
#: ddc6f01c306a448f82250ad5ac4cfa54 f4ff576b30c045debe1e16e4ab2bfc22
msgid ""
"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  7 (invert TX/RX, Half Duplex) if using \"un-"
"inverted\" FPort signal, then = 4 since inversion is not required)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 7（反转 TX/RX，半双工），若使用「非反转」FPort 信号则设为 = 4（无需反转）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:57
#: 10f1dc535dab4aa1adefda204f151567 19a165c999a04b0a8a9b5ddd5ada1049
#: 2281e5d857de4f23840b241d62fbcc99 8672246cc8c741a6a648584f629354be
#: d4aaedf207844ddd9ee375c0b2895835 f71d77513e8241a6b0ab902c31c90e47
msgid "OR to the RX pin:"
msgstr "或连接至 RX 引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:60
#: 03506221034042faa22a798f358f348f 27cce16d896748b2913e2db573910c1e
#: 443c76e91f6c405fa41597485553cec5 66cb5880224e466989a7579d3a62daae
#: c15077e78e1c4276bf1b1a26b22b3c20 f21bc82fdb0449a5984370f04af9ad16
msgid "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  15 (invert TX/RX,Half Duplex, SWAP TX/RX pins)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  15（反相 TX/RX，半双工，交换 TX/RX 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:64
#: 3a69b445413041649079beb45c3073da 5733a5a7d5024f0790463ea98365fe71
#: 82408671c885450ca745015e2a0cb9f1 8d726204b01048e6aff138626bddbba0
#: 9130ab3c424642f9b4e9eff97e4e242f b93fddbf56024ef5b28b0052094e3733
msgid ""
"Some F7/H7 autopilots have level/shifters on their UARTs that cause a delay "
"in Half Duplex operation, like CubeOrange. If the above configuration does "
"not, try setting :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` = 8 which will add padding in"
" the protocol to accommodate this. However, using this option when not "
"required will break operation."
msgstr ""
"部分 F7/H7 飞控（如 CubeOrange）的 UART 上有电平转换器，导致半双工操作延迟。如果上述配置无效，可尝试将 "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 设置为 8，这将在协议中添加填充以适应此延迟。但如果不需要此选项时使用它，则会导致操作失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:68
#: 14df49a71e4e498a838c5bf9bc10d292 3b8737a013f1405d91cbcdef02d58559
#: 84a267cde5b047d99ed45fd08b0bf3fd 85291adf03fc4dfc8c827246f6da243b
#: aef94fdfe2424fec9fd9d298e205eb6b e002b4654bdb43a2866dddbe1b90313a
msgid "Enhanced Configurations"
msgstr "高级配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:70
#: 6c945c60be6d4100a69a6461e59b83fd 6d009147f49642d5abb5a43aab84cbbf
#: 80410244327b426baa8d9341f78a31ed 95ab8616f0d74ab4b27ba65dea401b0c
#: dda74b9cfcb34c2d801626e273f832ac e9a149f0f57f4b6a8710c57fe8a9a708
msgid ""
"Since many autopilots have a UART tied to the normal RC input pin for that "
"autopilot which has been disabled, partially or totally, to allow that pins "
"use as a GPIO for RC protocol decodes, including the PWM based ones, several"
" boards now have alternate pin assignment which can be selected with the "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` parameter. This allows the use of "
"those previously disabled UARTs for FPort, without consuming an additional "
"UART."
msgstr ""
"由于许多飞控有一个 UART 绑定到该飞控的普通 RC 输入引脚上，且为允许该引脚用作 RC 协议解码（包括基于 PWM 的协议）的 GPIO "
"而被部分或完全禁用，目前多款飞控板支持通过 :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` "
"参数选择备用引脚分配。这允许将之前禁用的 UART 用于 FPort，而不额外占用一个 UART。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-FPort-receivers.rst:72
#: 0c65dfd13bbd40fd8b4309b818235103 442b994195a64c7f8769830960a6ca14
#: 8fea20e411c4443f898469984670e4dd d309c533cec84103bfa2cde3e49fa88a
#: dd20adf20c444badb62ed8086f5a5505 dd4f0899308845c58b1a7d4482c5d6d4
msgid ""
"Several autopilots (e.g. Pixhawkx, Cube, etc.) that use an IOMCU co-"
"processor do not have alternate configurations allowing the use of the RCIN "
